# An expunge in all mail is the one operation that means the message
# is to be gone rather than merely moved out of sight, so it leaves
# every mailbox its owner has.
depends allmail
send 1
e store 3 +flags \deleted
receive 2
* 3 FETCH (UID 3 FLAGS (\Deleted))
e OK done
send 1
f expunge
receive 2
* 3 EXPUNGE
f OK done
send 1
g select inbox
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 19 EXISTS
* 19 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 21] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
g OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
h uid fetch 1:5 uid
receive 5
* 1 FETCH (UID 1)
* 2 FETCH (UID 2)
* 3 FETCH (UID 4)
* 4 FETCH (UID 5)
h OK done
end
